  commentary: '10 . Thus he spoke, and it was done, Ps 33 9 . Thus, says our apostle, by the word of the Lord the heavens were, as they were of old (that is, at first creation) and the earth (as it was at first a terraqueous globe) standing out of the water and in the water.',
