  commentary: 'Even he shall build the temple of the Lord. He shall grow up to do good, to be an instrument of God\'s glory and a great blessing to mankind. Note, The gospel-church is the temple of the Lord, a spiritual house ( 1 Pet 2 5 ), a holy temple, Eph 2 21 .',
  sourceTitle: 'Matthew Henry\'s Complete Commentary on Zechariah 6',
